<view class="factory-page" bindtouchstart="activity"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">工厂入驻</view><view class="heading">输入工厂邀请码</view><view class="muted">请联系平台获取邀请码。锁定后可继续完善资料，提交前请留意有效期。</view></view><view class="card"><text class="label">邀请码</text><input value="{{code}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="请输入20位邀请码" maxlength="60"/><view class="note">邀请码仅限本人使用；工厂方与租赁方身份互斥。</view></view><view class="feedback" wx:if="{{message}}">{{message}}</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !code}}" bindtap="claim">验证并继续</button></view>